WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.907
Welcome to Module 11. We are extending the Pandas foundation from Module 10 into more advanced workflows.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:14.957
The emphasis is on chaining operations, reshaping tables, working with dates and rolling summaries,

00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:20.201
checking joins, and packaging repeated Pandas logic into reusable functions.
